<p>
<md>g(X,Y)=\omega(X,JY)</md>
</p>

<p>behaves like a metric.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Explain why every K\"ahler manifold is symplectic.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

